* -text whitespace=blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol
# Existing Markdown uses intentional hard line breaks and preserved blank lines.
*.md whitespace=-blank-at-eol,-blank-at-eof,cr-at-eol
*.png binary
*.pptx binary
*.pt binary
*.npz binary
*.zip binary
